WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:02.868
-Our next guest
has his new comedy special,

00:00:02.868 --> 00:00:05.300
"Hat Trick,"
available now on YouTube.

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:06.901
Making his "Tonight Show" debut,

00:00:06.901 --> 00:00:09.734
please welcome the very funny
Fahim Anwar.

00:00:09.734 --> 00:00:11.734
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:11.734 --> 00:00:15.000
♪♪

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:17.968
-Oh, guys.
Guys!

00:00:17.968 --> 00:00:20.200
[ Cheers and applause ]
Come on.

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:22.400
Oh, guys, please.
Thank you.

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:24.601
Oh, you're too nice.
Come on.

00:00:24.601 --> 00:00:27.033
Thank you for having me.
It's an honor to be here.

00:00:27.033 --> 00:00:28.634
I flew in last night.

00:00:28.634 --> 00:00:32.000
This is just, like, a PSA
to everyone out here tonight.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:34.868
When you fly,
wait to get off the plane.

00:00:34.868 --> 00:00:35.868
[ Laughter ]

00:00:35.868 --> 00:00:37.767
It's not very hard.

00:00:37.767 --> 00:00:40.000
But for some reason, as soon as
the wheels touch down,

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:42.167
everybody gets up like...

00:00:42.167 --> 00:00:52.167
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:52.167 --> 00:00:55.000
For 40 minutes, this guy's like,
"Can you believe this?"

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:57.534
[ Laughter ]

00:00:57.534 --> 00:00:59.133
He goes to the chiropractor
the next day, like,

00:00:59.133 --> 00:01:00.467
"It happened again.
I couldn't wait. Can you...?"

00:01:00.467 --> 00:01:01.534
[ Laughter ]

00:01:01.534 --> 00:01:03.634
Ckk!

00:01:03.634 --> 00:01:05.400
I have to fly around a lot
doing stand-up.

00:01:05.400 --> 00:01:06.701
You know, it's part of the job.

00:01:06.701 --> 00:01:08.501
And my mom,
she's very overprotective.

00:01:08.501 --> 00:01:10.400
Whenever she finds out
about a gig,

00:01:10.400 --> 00:01:12.367
she'll call me up
the night before.

00:01:12.367 --> 00:01:14.501
She'll be like,
"I want your flight number."

00:01:14.501 --> 00:01:15.801
[ Laughter ]

00:01:15.801 --> 00:01:18.133
"I want the name
of the comedy booker."

00:01:18.133 --> 00:01:19.334
[ Laughter ]

00:01:19.334 --> 00:01:21.267
Like, my mom thinks she's
Liam Neeson from "Taken."

00:01:21.267 --> 00:01:24.067
[ Laughter ]

00:01:24.067 --> 00:01:25.334
Like, if something were
to happen to me,

00:01:25.334 --> 00:01:27.734
she would just show up like,
psh, psh, psh, psh!

00:01:27.734 --> 00:01:30.033
I'm like, "Mom, thank God I gave
you his contact info!"

00:01:30.033 --> 00:01:33.334
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:33.334 --> 00:01:35.667
"Untie me.
Yeah!

00:01:35.667 --> 00:01:38.300
Sorry, boys,
but I tell my mom everything."

00:01:38.300 --> 00:01:41.801
[ Laughter ]

00:01:41.801 --> 00:01:43.067
"We're very close."

00:01:43.067 --> 00:01:45.100
[ Laughter ]

00:01:45.100 --> 00:01:47.501
I love people watching
at the airport.

00:01:47.501 --> 00:01:50.100
I love the guy who never
takes his neck pillow off.

00:01:50.100 --> 00:01:52.501
[ Laughter ]

00:01:52.501 --> 00:01:54.467
He just looks like
a "Star Wars" Senator.

00:01:54.467 --> 00:01:56.634
[ Laughter ]

00:01:56.634 --> 00:01:59.467
"I have to get
to the Galactic Senate.

00:01:59.467 --> 00:02:02.033
Southwest has direct flights
to Tatooine."

00:02:02.033 --> 00:02:04.267
[ Laughter ]

00:02:04.267 --> 00:02:06.033
Sometimes this will happen
on a flight.

00:02:06.033 --> 00:02:07.767
You know, a woman will be like,

00:02:07.767 --> 00:02:10.200
"Oh, can you, like,
help me with my bag?"

00:02:10.200 --> 00:02:11.434
And I'm happy to help
every time.

00:02:11.434 --> 00:02:14.300
I'm like, "Oh, yeah, of course."
And I'll help her.

00:02:14.300 --> 00:02:16.868
But then I always think
that's such a luxury, ladies.

00:02:16.868 --> 00:02:19.067
[ Laughter ]

00:02:19.067 --> 00:02:21.300
That, like, half the population
can help you with your bag.

00:02:21.300 --> 00:02:22.601
[ Laughter ]

00:02:22.601 --> 00:02:25.300
Like, when I pack, I have to
pack for my own strength.

00:02:25.300 --> 00:02:34.934
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:34.934 --> 00:02:36.200
Yeah.
I can't be all like,

00:02:36.200 --> 00:02:38.267
"I'll probably bump into
Hulk Hogan on my flight."

00:02:38.267 --> 00:02:39.767
[ Laughter ]

00:02:39.767 --> 00:02:40.868
"Hey, Hulk,
can you help me out?"

00:02:40.868 --> 00:02:42.434
He's like,
"You got it, brother!"

00:02:42.434 --> 00:02:45.501
[ Laughter ]

00:02:45.501 --> 00:02:47.667
"You're lucky you bumped
into me, little guy."

00:02:47.667 --> 00:02:50.334
[ Laughter ]

00:02:50.334 --> 00:02:52.300
Sometimes they'll have
the drug-sniffing dog

00:02:52.300 --> 00:02:53.801
at the airport.

00:02:53.801 --> 00:02:57.767
It always has that vest
that says, "Do not pet."

00:02:57.767 --> 00:03:01.133
That's how you know that dog
shouldn't be a cop.

00:03:01.133 --> 00:03:03.934
If, like, petting it will
blow up the whole operation...

00:03:03.934 --> 00:03:05.934
[ Laughter ]

00:03:05.934 --> 00:03:07.934
Imagine a cop was like, "You
know why I pulled you over?"

00:03:07.934 --> 00:03:09.601
And you start petting him,
and he's like...

00:03:09.601 --> 00:03:12.133
[ Laughter ]

00:03:12.133 --> 00:03:13.133
"Stop it!"

00:03:13.133 --> 00:03:15.133
[ Applause ]

00:03:15.133 --> 00:03:17.901
"Cut it out!"

00:03:17.901 --> 00:03:19.267
Start rubbing his belly.

00:03:19.267 --> 00:03:20.601
He's like, "I'm gonna let you
off with a warning."

00:03:20.601 --> 00:03:23.400
[ Laughter ]

00:03:23.400 --> 00:03:26.634
"Get out of here
before I change my mind."

00:03:26.634 --> 00:03:29.100
"He had a tennis ball, Sarge.
What was I supposed to do?"

00:03:29.100 --> 00:03:33.133
[ Laughter ]

00:03:33.133 --> 00:03:35.100
This may be
a controversial opinion.

00:03:35.100 --> 00:03:38.100
I think ladies
kind of overestimate

00:03:38.100 --> 00:03:41.067
how good they are at dancing.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:41.067 --> 00:03:42.367
Just a little bit.

00:03:42.367 --> 00:03:43.868
I was on a date with this girl,
and she was like,

00:03:43.868 --> 00:03:48.801
"Yeah, I'm an amazing dancer.
I'm so good."

00:03:48.801 --> 00:03:52.067
And then I saw her dance,
and she was just doing this...

00:03:52.067 --> 00:03:56.934
[ Laughter ]

00:03:56.934 --> 00:03:58.501
It was a lot of shoulders,
you know?

00:03:58.501 --> 00:03:59.834
Just...

00:03:59.834 --> 00:04:02.467
That's vibing.
I'll give you that.

00:04:02.467 --> 00:04:03.834
But guys will come up to you
and be like,

00:04:03.834 --> 00:04:05.567
"Whoa, you're, like,
an amazing dancer."

00:04:05.567 --> 00:04:07.467
[ Laughter ]

00:04:07.467 --> 00:04:09.601
Because they want
to be with you, you know?

00:04:09.601 --> 00:04:13.200
Men will humor you.
You won't humor us.

00:04:13.200 --> 00:04:15.701
Like, if I'm at the club like...

00:04:15.701 --> 00:04:19.200
[ Laughter ]

00:04:19.200 --> 00:04:21.334
No girl's coming up to me, like,
"Holy crap.

00:04:21.334 --> 00:04:22.534
You're, like,
an amazing dancer."

00:04:22.534 --> 00:04:25.367
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:25.367 --> 00:04:27.167
"Are you, like,
a Jabbawockeez or something?"

00:04:27.167 --> 00:04:29.334
[ Laughter ]

00:04:29.334 --> 00:04:31.167
"No, I'm self-taught,
believe it or not."

00:04:31.167 --> 00:04:32.300
[ Laughter ]

00:04:32.300 --> 00:04:33.767
"It's TikTok."

00:04:33.767 --> 00:04:36.167
[ Laughter ]

00:04:36.167 --> 00:04:38.934
Yeah, men will humor you.
You -- You won't humor us.

00:04:38.934 --> 00:04:40.534
Like, guys will be on a date
with a girl,

00:04:40.534 --> 00:04:44.968
and the girl will be like,
"Yeah, you know, I'm a Wiccan.

00:04:44.968 --> 00:04:48.234
Yeah, I practice witchcraft."
[ Laughter ]

00:04:48.234 --> 00:04:50.667
And guys are like,
"Oh, my God, that's crazy."

00:04:50.667 --> 00:04:52.567
[ Laughter ]

00:04:52.567 --> 00:04:54.901
"Is that, like, an indoor thing
or an outdoor thing?"

00:04:54.901 --> 00:05:00.067
[ Laughter ]

00:05:00.067 --> 00:05:01.234
"No, I've heard of Wiccans.

00:05:01.234 --> 00:05:06.133
I just -- I never met one
in real life. Wow."

00:05:06.133 --> 00:05:08.968
If I go on a date
and say I'm a wizard...

00:05:08.968 --> 00:05:11.467
[ Laughter ]

00:05:11.467 --> 00:05:19.634
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:19.634 --> 00:05:21.067
...the date's over.

00:05:21.067 --> 00:05:22.901
[ Laughter ]

00:05:22.901 --> 00:05:25.434
She's not like, "When did you
get into wizardry?"

00:05:25.434 --> 00:05:26.801
[ Laughter ]

00:05:26.801 --> 00:05:27.767
All right.
You guys were a lot of fun.

00:05:27.767 --> 00:05:29.300
Thanks so much.
I'm Fahim Anwar.

00:05:29.300 --> 00:05:32.367
Thank you.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:32.367 --> 00:05:35.167
-Yo!
Come on, now!

00:05:35.167 --> 00:05:37.467
That's how you do it
right there.

00:05:37.467 --> 00:05:40.334
Fahim Anwar!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:40.334 --> 00:05:42.000
Oh, you got
a standing ovation there.

00:05:42.000 --> 00:05:43.167
-Come on.
I love you guys.

00:05:43.167 --> 00:05:45.734
-"Hat Trick" is available now
on YouTube.

00:05:45.734 --> 00:05:47.133
We'll be right back.

